flowchart TD
    A[Content Manifest] --> B{Schema current?}
    B -- no --> C[Migrate deterministically]
    C --> D[Preflight]
    B -- yes --> D
    D -- fail --> X[ABSTAIN / REVISE]
    D -- pass --> E[Seal Manifest]
    E --> F[Replay Fingerprint]
    F --> G{Explicit render authorization?}
    G -- no --> H[Dry-run package only]
    G -- yes --> I[Budget + concurrency gate]
    I -- fail --> X
    I -- pass --> J[Deterministic Render Intent ID]
    J --> K{Intent exists in ledger?}
    K -- yes --> L[RECONCILE_REQUIRED]
    K -- no --> M[Append AUTHORIZED event]
    M --> N[Compile provider request]
    N --> O[Submit to provider]
    O --> P{Acknowledgement observed?}
    P -- yes --> Q[Append ACKNOWLEDGED / RUNNING]
    P -- no, definitely before accept --> R[FAILED_RETRYABLE]
    P -- ambiguous --> L
    Q --> S{Provider terminal state}
    S -- completed + valid asset --> T[Append COMPLETED]
    S -- failed known --> U[FAILED_FINAL]
    S -- malformed / asset missing --> L
    L --> V[Provider reconciliation lookup]
    V --> W{Job exists?}
    W -- yes --> Q
    W -- no + bounded retry available --> R
    W -- unknown --> X
    T --> Y[Verify manifest seal before downstream]
    Y -- fail --> X
    Y -- pass --> Z[Downstream edit graph]
    Z --> AA[Performance observation]
    AA --> AB[Correlation/Hypothesis]
    AB --> AC[Repeated pattern / controlled test]
    AC --> AD{Explicit promotion approval}
    AD -- no --> AE[Keep as evidence only]
    AD -- yes --> AF[Promoted learning rule]

    GH[GitHub control truth] --> RR[Replica digests]
    DR[Drive recovery replica] --> RR
    LB[Library command replica] --> RR
    RR --> RS{Hashes/revisions agree?}
    RS -- yes --> RT[Replica MATCH]
    RS -- canonical newer --> RU[STALE_REPLICA / refresh allowed]
    RS -- replica newer or divergent --> RV[CONFLICT / manual reconciliation]
